<BaseLayout>

<section class="about">

  <div class="about-left">

    <img
      src="/images/projects/sebas.webp"
      alt="Sebastián Sarmiento"
      class="about-photo"
    />

  </div>

  <div class="about-right">

<h2>ABOUT</h2>

<p class="about-role">
  FILM DIRECTOR · CREATIVE PRODUCER · AI FILMMAKER
</p>

    <p>
      I made my first video when I was twelve. It was a collection of videos of the strangest people who passed in front of my house at night. I invented voice-over narrations about who they might be and why they dared to cross a dangerous neighborhood.    </p>

    <p>
      I earned a Bachelor's degree in Film from Universidad Nacional de Colombia and, while in my third semester, won an India Catalina Award at FICCI, LATAM's oldest film festival, for a short doc. That recognition led to a scholarship to pursue an MFA in Directing at NYFA in Los Angeles.
    </p>

    <p>
      I've directed award-winning short films and led video productions for global brands. Today, I work across film, commercials, and AI while continuing to develop original independent cinema from emerging LATAM voices.
    </p>

    <p class="signature">
      — Sebas
    </p>

    <div class="spacer"></div>

